{"quest_id": 4784, "name": "呪いの弾丸", "description": "闇ギルドを探る為\n黒シャチ海賊団のアジトへ。\n海賊の長距離射撃に立ち向かえ！\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "event": "武器商人と呪いの武器", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920081, "map_no": 3926, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 90, "exp": 360, "gold": 1400, "drops": [{"item": 5003, "c": 2}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"card": 123, "c": 1}, {"card": 58, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 30, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 250, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 251, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2103680, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 464, "global_id": 463, "ranged": true, "phases": [{"hp": 3000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 300, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 251, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2103680, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 465, "global_id": 464, "ranged": true, "condition": 3}], "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 10000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 250, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 251, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2108464, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 112, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 30032, "global_id": 3651, "ranged": true, "phases": [{"hp": 10000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 10000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 300, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 251, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2108464, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 112, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 30033, "global_id": 3652, "ranged": true, "condition": 3}], "spawn_sec": 4}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 15000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 290, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 150, "attack_interval": 346, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103616, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 5, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 459, "global_id": 458, "ranged": true, "phases": [{"hp": 15000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 450, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 150, "attack_interval": 346, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103616, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 463, "global_id": 462, "ranged": true, "condition": 3}], "spawn_sec": 166}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "セシリー", "text": "……見つけた。\nあれが黒シャチ海賊団だ。", "face": "u21"}, {"name": "エイミー", "text": "いかにも悪そうな見た目をしてますね……。\nそれに見て下さい。\n彼ら「呪いの武器」を所持してます！", "face": "u414"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "あぁ？　誰だお前ら？\n俺達に何か用でもあるのか？", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "エイミー", "text": "私は武器専門の商人です。\n貴方達が持っている武器に興味があるのですが、\n一体誰から買ったのですか？", "face": "u414"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "はぁ？　教えるわけねぇだろ。\n俺達は最強の海賊団なんだぜぇ？\n仕入先を教えちゃ最強じゃなくなっちまうじゃねぇか。", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "エイミー", "text": "あ、お金ですね！\nそれならばきちんと払いますのでご安心を。\nえ～っと……よいしょ、これくらいでどうでしょうか？", "face": "u414"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "ほ～さすが武器商人、羽振りが良いじゃねぇか。\nだが、これっぽっちじゃぜんぜん足りねぇなぁ。\nそこの美人の姉ちゃんも置いていきな。", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……わ、私ですか？", "face": "l2b6c2348d305"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "……！", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "おいッ、なに無言で割って入ってんだよ！\n俺の女とでも言いてぇのか？\n……気にくわねぇなぁ。", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "いいだろう、海賊の流儀に則って\n女は力で奪い取ってやらぁ！", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "くっそぉ……一体なんだってんだ。\n全然、体力が持たなかったぜ……。\n悪かったよ……か、勘弁してくれねぇか？", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "エイミー", "text": "それでは「呪いの武器」をあなた達に売った人について\n教えてくれますか？　あ、あとこの武器は\n元々私のなので回収させて頂きますね。", "face": "u414"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "……ち、仕方ねぇ。殺されないだけマシだろうしな。", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "アンタ等が探してる武器の売人は、\nもう少しで俺達のところにまた取引しにくるぜ。\nそこでヤツと話をつければいい。", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "黒シャチ海賊団", "text": "――っと、ちょうど来たみたいだぜ。\nあいつが俺達に「呪いの武器」を売ったヤツだ。", "face": "lffbad18605e2"}, {"name": "売人", "text": "おーい、黒シャチ海賊団ども。\nアンタらが欲しがってた武具一式もってきてやったぞ。\nほら、約束通りさっさと全部買い取りなー。", "face": "l0dd435fdd151"}, {"name": "エイミー", "text": "あなたが盗品を売り捌いている悪い売人ですね！\nその「呪いの武器」は元々私のものです！\nすぐに返して下さい！", "face": "u414"}, {"name": "売人", "text": "――ぬわッ！？\nおい、黒シャチ海賊団！　これはどういうことだよ！\n……くっそぉ、こんなところで捕まってたまるかー！", "face": "l0dd435fdd151"}, {"name": "エイミー", "text": "ああッ！？　ちょっと、どこに逃げようって言うんですか！\n……もう、絶対に逃がしたりしませんからね。\n王子、はやく追いかけましょう！", "face": "u414"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920081_3926", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 947, "y": 328}, {"k": "m", "x": 824, "y": 266, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 378, "y": 492, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 687, "y": 333, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 583, "y": 390, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 576, "y": 268, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 385, "y": 261, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 406, "y": 168, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 100, "y": 219, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 281, "y"